WEBVTT

00:11.011 --> 00:12.387
ZAGAN 50 KM
BERITH 10 KM

00:13.513 --> 00:14.931
Hey. What is that?

00:30.321 --> 00:32.157
Mr. En is dead.

00:32.907 --> 00:37.162
All the mushrooms created
by Mr. En's magic have rotted away.

00:37.245 --> 00:41.666
Because of that,
the whole world learned of Mr. En's death.

02:11.047 --> 02:12.924
THE BEGINNING

02:21.766 --> 02:23.393
CHAOS SHOCK

02:23.476 --> 02:27.772
Apparently, the mansion was in total chaos
after I lost consciousness.

02:28.273 --> 02:33.194
Shin and Noi noticed something was off
and returned, but it was already too late.

02:33.945 --> 02:37.615
The culprit escaped through an air duct

02:38.116 --> 02:40.201
and took Mr. En's head with him.

02:40.785 --> 02:42.704
Shin followed the blood trail,

02:43.288 --> 02:47.792
but the culprit's tracks ended abruptly
inside the mansion.

02:53.298 --> 02:57.093
In the end,
the culprit has still not been caught.

03:04.184 --> 03:07.687
Ebisu was looking for Kikurage
with snacks in hand.

03:07.770 --> 03:08.605
Oh, yeah.

03:09.397 --> 03:11.608
Kikurage had also disappeared.

03:12.442 --> 03:14.110
And Chota too.

03:14.736 --> 03:16.446
Even that Nikaido.

03:17.906 --> 03:20.366
Ebisu was laughing as always,

03:20.450 --> 03:23.536
but for some reason,
she looked very lonely.

03:25.079 --> 03:27.790
Shin and the others asked me several times

03:27.874 --> 03:32.295
about the headless man and the culprit
who tried to take Mr. En's head.

03:33.630 --> 03:36.007
But no matter how hard I try to recall,

03:37.467 --> 03:39.385
the darkness of that duct

03:40.345 --> 03:41.971
was too terrifying.

03:42.472 --> 03:44.057
I don't want to remember.

03:46.851 --> 03:51.022
It felt like everything fell apart
in an instant somehow.

03:54.442 --> 03:57.528
His death has had various effects
in every region.

03:57.612 --> 03:58.821
CHAOS SPREADS EVERYWHERE

03:58.905 --> 04:01.824
The Magic World,
ruled by En's overwhelming power,

04:01.908 --> 04:03.117
has lost its leader.

04:03.201 --> 04:06.037
It is expected that the chaos will spread...

04:06.704 --> 04:08.581
It's Noi, right? Come in.

04:08.665 --> 04:12.085
Thanks. Shin, do you have a moment?

04:12.710 --> 04:14.921
SCOOP: MR. EN'S MURDER
UNMASKING THE KILLER

04:15.004 --> 04:19.425
Shin, I hated En.

04:19.509 --> 04:24.514
Since I was a kid,
he used my magic for his own convenience

04:24.597 --> 04:26.933
and was an arrogant mushroom dumbass.

04:27.016 --> 04:30.603
So I'm not sad that En died,

04:31.437 --> 04:36.442
but the mansion is getting
out of control without him.

04:36.526 --> 04:40.947
No one's cooking, cleaning, or working.

04:41.614 --> 04:44.534
And fewer people
are looking for the Cross-Eyes.

04:44.617 --> 04:47.412
Everyone got scared and ran away.

04:47.912 --> 04:51.749
People were afraid of Mr. En,
but thanks to him,

04:51.833 --> 04:53.876
this world was somewhat decent.

04:54.502 --> 04:58.423
Shin, it was the Cross-Eyes boss
who killed En, right?

04:58.506 --> 05:00.174
Almost certainly.

05:00.258 --> 05:03.553
The physical discomfort
Fujita felt right before

05:04.262 --> 05:08.349
was the same
as when he fought him six years ago.

05:08.433 --> 05:13.521
Then let's find him, get En's head back,
and bring him back to life.

05:13.604 --> 05:17.650
But Kikurage,
who is essential, is missing.

05:17.734 --> 05:21.904
Kikurage, Chota, and Nikaido's corpses
haven't been found, right?

05:21.988 --> 05:23.948
They might all still be alive.

05:26.409 --> 05:29.537
What are you going to do now, Shin?

05:30.413 --> 05:35.209
Me? I'm just going to do
my job as a cleaner.

05:35.293 --> 05:37.837
I'm going to find him and kill him.

05:38.421 --> 05:40.423
I'm getting excited.

05:42.175 --> 05:44.093
That's right, Shin!

05:44.177 --> 05:45.803
That's our job!

05:45.887 --> 05:47.638
I completely forgot!

05:49.140 --> 05:52.185
I got tired of thinking
about all the little details.

05:53.394 --> 05:55.813
- I'll take a nap here--
- Go to your own room!

05:55.897 --> 05:56.939
Excuse me.

05:57.023 --> 05:58.816
- What?
- Whoa! Am I interrupting?

05:58.900 --> 06:00.860
- No, you've got it wrong!
- Hello.

06:00.943 --> 06:05.198
Oh, Turkey. It's been a while.

06:08.034 --> 06:11.579
Nikaido.

06:12.955 --> 06:14.123
Nikaido!

06:14.832 --> 06:18.086
Big Brother Kawajiri.

06:24.967 --> 06:26.219
Caiman.

06:26.719 --> 06:28.638
Hey, Caiman.

06:28.721 --> 06:31.891
You've got the wrong guy. I'm Aikawa.

06:32.975 --> 06:36.396
I'm a Sorcerer just like you.

06:37.105 --> 06:41.651
Stop it! I gave up magic.

06:42.527 --> 06:45.530
Because of that power, Yakumo and I...

06:54.205 --> 06:59.377
Nikaido, I'm very lucky. Do you know why?

07:03.214 --> 07:05.633
Yakumo!

07:09.220 --> 07:13.724
If I hadn't used magic...

07:14.684 --> 07:16.644
BLACK BOX

07:18.646 --> 07:20.898
Where is this?

07:20.982 --> 07:24.444
Did I come here
because of this square thing?

07:24.527 --> 07:26.904
I don't even know which button does what.

07:27.572 --> 07:28.906
This thing is useless!

07:28.990 --> 07:30.450
What is this place?!

07:32.660 --> 07:34.579
This river...

07:36.706 --> 07:38.374
It's Uncle and Auntie.

07:38.458 --> 07:40.877
Uncle! Auntie!

07:40.960 --> 07:43.880
Who are you calling "Auntie"?
I'm not that old.

07:43.963 --> 07:45.131
Whose kid is this?

07:46.090 --> 07:48.176
I'm Nikaido, Uncle.

07:48.259 --> 07:49.343
I don't know you.

07:49.427 --> 07:52.638
We just happened to be
taking a walk around here.

07:53.431 --> 07:57.226
Uncle and Auntie seem different
from how they usually are.

07:57.727 --> 08:01.230
Could this be the past?

08:02.231 --> 08:05.151
Then, is this my magic?

08:10.406 --> 08:15.786
Big Bro Kawajiri, I went to the past
by using that square box today.

08:15.870 --> 08:19.373
I met Uncle and Auntie
when they were young there.

08:23.002 --> 08:27.298
Magic that manipulates time
is just a legend. It doesn't exist.

08:27.381 --> 08:29.342
Don't lie, Nikaido.

08:29.425 --> 08:30.676
I'm not lying!

08:31.886 --> 08:32.929
Wait.

08:33.721 --> 08:34.680
Where's Yakumo?

08:35.556 --> 08:36.891
Yakumo?

08:37.558 --> 08:39.185
What do you mean by Yakumo?

08:41.854 --> 08:42.688
What?

08:46.609 --> 08:50.196
Why is everyone pretending
they don't know Yakumo?

08:50.780 --> 08:53.574
It's like she never existed.

08:54.283 --> 08:58.538
When I was a baby,
I floated down this river.

08:58.621 --> 09:02.291
Uncle and Auntie happened to be
passing by and picked me up.

09:02.792 --> 09:07.713
If they had looked away for even a second,
I would've probably stayed...

09:21.811 --> 09:24.480
Yakumo!

09:30.194 --> 09:31.696
AN UNNAMED SOUL
LIES HERE

09:31.779 --> 09:32.613
Nikaido!

09:34.073 --> 09:36.617
Big Bro Kawajiri.

09:38.452 --> 09:43.124
This is a town about 200 kilometers
south of En's mansion.

09:43.708 --> 09:45.835
While you were unconscious,

09:45.918 --> 09:49.130
I bought some healing smoke
and healed our wounds.

09:49.213 --> 09:51.215
Thanks, Asu.

09:51.757 --> 09:53.884
My arms and legs are as good as new.

09:53.968 --> 09:58.681
Wait, why did the healing smoke work?

09:58.764 --> 10:00.891
And my body stopped mushrooming.

10:02.018 --> 10:03.644
He was killed?

10:03.728 --> 10:07.148
No way. How could that happen to En?

10:07.231 --> 10:09.108
Could it have been Caiman?

10:09.191 --> 10:10.067
Who knows?

10:10.151 --> 10:14.905
All I know is
people are saying the Cross-Eyes did it.

10:15.740 --> 10:16.907
The Cross-Eyes?

10:16.991 --> 10:22.246
I don't know if it's Caiman or Aikawa,
but if you plan to chase him, I'm in.

10:22.330 --> 10:23.914
Thanks, Asu.

10:23.998 --> 10:30.171
By the way, when you had nightmares,
you kept calling me "Big Bro Kawajiri."

10:30.254 --> 10:33.591
I don't think I ever told you my name.

10:34.759 --> 10:38.387
And you said I saved you a long time ago.

10:38.471 --> 10:41.599
Maybe this has something to do
with your magic?

10:42.433 --> 10:46.187
Do you remember when we first met?

10:48.397 --> 10:52.610
I was just about to enter
the final stage of the Devil exam.

10:53.235 --> 10:58.115
The last few days of the exam are set
to coincide with the Blue Night Festival.

11:02.036 --> 11:05.998
People who wanted to become my partners
were chasing after me.

11:07.458 --> 11:13.339
Since I couldn't use magic
until the exam was over, I was on edge.

11:14.048 --> 11:17.677
That's when I first met you.

11:20.513 --> 11:24.183
You wouldn't leave my side
for some reason.

11:24.975 --> 11:26.352
And that day...

11:27.937 --> 11:29.355
What will you do?

11:29.438 --> 11:31.148
Use magic?

11:31.232 --> 11:34.235
Give up on the Devil exam
and choose a partner?

11:34.318 --> 11:37.488
If I have to make a contract
with you guys...

11:44.620 --> 11:46.914
- What the...
- Hurry! Get out of here!

11:46.997 --> 11:48.916
I won't let you go... Whoa!

11:50.000 --> 11:54.672
Thanks to you saving me,
I was able to become a Devil.

11:56.716 --> 11:59.802
I went to thank you
after I became a Devil,

11:59.885 --> 12:03.639
but you had already started
thinking about living in the Hole.

12:04.640 --> 12:10.563
With my Devil powers, I learned
that your magic was related to time.

12:10.646 --> 12:14.024
You refused to use your magic

12:14.525 --> 12:16.986
because you had lost something precious.

12:17.862 --> 12:21.449
But you're not the same as you were
when you were a child.

12:21.532 --> 12:23.951
Use your magic, Nikaido.

12:24.452 --> 12:27.830
Use your magic to take back what you lost.

12:28.456 --> 12:31.542
No. I can't, Asu.

12:31.625 --> 12:34.837
My magic is really dangerous.

12:34.920 --> 12:39.175
You were turned back into a Sorcerer
because of me.

12:41.135 --> 12:43.846
I was able to become a Devil
thanks to you.

12:43.929 --> 12:47.850
I don't mind
giving up being a Devil for you.

12:48.434 --> 12:49.518
Asu...

12:52.897 --> 12:56.025
I'll use my magic
to take back what I lost.

12:57.860 --> 13:00.446
Thanks to that En guy dying,

13:00.529 --> 13:03.616
security around the mansion's
gotten thin, Johnson.

13:04.658 --> 13:08.078
We still haven't found the room
where they summon Devils, but--

13:08.871 --> 13:09.830
What is it, Jonson?

13:10.539 --> 13:11.582
What?

13:11.665 --> 13:13.709
Good evening, Hayes.

13:13.793 --> 13:17.463
Haru? You turned back into a Sorcerer?

13:24.470 --> 13:26.013
Surprised, aren't you?

13:26.514 --> 13:27.723
It's a huge success.

13:29.099 --> 13:30.726
What do you mean?

13:30.810 --> 13:33.479
I wanted to surprise you, Hayes.

13:33.562 --> 13:36.232
Both of us are the real me.

13:36.315 --> 13:41.570
But it's dangerous.
If I stay out for too long, I'll die.

13:42.071 --> 13:43.614
This is bad.

13:43.697 --> 13:46.700
I feel more at ease
in this form, after all.

13:46.784 --> 13:49.203
Devils are amazing.

13:49.286 --> 13:51.622
Obviously. We're invincible.

13:51.705 --> 13:54.041
I really want to dissect you.

13:55.251 --> 13:59.129
It's been a while
since I've listened to your nonsense.

14:03.509 --> 14:08.389
Then, to celebrate our reunion,
I'll sing you a song.

14:08.472 --> 14:09.390
What?

14:10.140 --> 14:12.893
Tiny, inferior, insignificant creatures
That's what humans are

14:12.977 --> 14:15.396
I eat them when I'm hungry
But they're not tasty

14:15.479 --> 14:16.397
So lame when scared

14:16.480 --> 14:19.400
They live for 90 years at most

14:19.483 --> 14:20.401
Ah, too funny

14:23.904 --> 14:26.448
That's a song about humans.

14:26.532 --> 14:30.077
It's my hobby to sing about
what I feel at the moment.

14:30.160 --> 14:35.416
Anyway, I was looking for you
because I wanted to ask for your help.

14:35.499 --> 14:37.543
Will you come with me?

14:37.626 --> 14:43.841
Now, now, don't be in such a hurry.
It's not too late to see my special trick.

14:44.341 --> 14:46.886
You've changed a little.

14:50.848 --> 14:56.687
This time, we're going to make the doll
using the fastest baking method.

14:57.521 --> 15:02.192
I never thought I'd be making a doll
of Mr. En in this way.

15:02.902 --> 15:06.780
I hope this will help us catch
the person who killed him.

15:06.864 --> 15:08.991
Leave that to us.

15:09.074 --> 15:11.785
Make a good doll, Turkey.

15:14.288 --> 15:18.000
First, cut the special cheese,
vegetables, and salami.

15:18.083 --> 15:19.209
Next,

15:19.960 --> 15:23.339
put them on this dough
that has been fermented to perfection,

15:24.340 --> 15:27.593
lightly flour it,
and roll it into a circle.

15:29.178 --> 15:33.599
Then stretch it out and make it even.

15:34.183 --> 15:37.978
Next, spread tomato sauce on the dough,

15:38.479 --> 15:41.357
put the toppings on,
and sprinkle on powdered cheese.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.691
Finally,

15:42.775 --> 15:48.113
I'll attach the smoke
I imagined Mr. En with to this oil can,

15:48.197 --> 15:51.158
pour it over the dough,

15:52.451 --> 15:53.869
and put it in the oven.

15:56.956 --> 16:00.376
Now we just have to wait for it to bake.

16:00.960 --> 16:06.632
If we follow the doll,
we'll have to fight the Cross-Eyes again.

16:06.715 --> 16:08.676
I hope it bakes quickly.

16:08.759 --> 16:13.597
Did you forget how we got worked over
by them in the Hydra Forest, Noi?

16:13.681 --> 16:15.307
I remember.

16:15.391 --> 16:18.644
They targeted the places
where you cannot produce smoke.

16:18.727 --> 16:21.188
So you do get it.

16:21.271 --> 16:24.900
So based on the location of the pipes,

16:24.984 --> 16:28.195
Mr. Kasukabe had him write down
the places likely to be targeted.

16:28.278 --> 16:29.780
That brat?!

16:29.863 --> 16:32.700
It should be done baking soon.

16:35.869 --> 16:37.705
Let's cut him out of the dough.

16:37.788 --> 16:39.790
Butt!

16:52.136 --> 16:53.595
It's done.

16:53.679 --> 16:57.057
The doll should head to the corpse now.

16:57.641 --> 17:00.936
But Mr. En's body
from the neck down is in the morgue.

17:01.437 --> 17:03.272
Any chance it'll go there?

17:03.355 --> 17:05.190
Don't worry about that.

17:05.274 --> 17:09.069
The doll will react
to the tumor in the head.

17:11.030 --> 17:12.865
He's already moving.

17:12.948 --> 17:13.866
Let's follow him.

17:14.867 --> 17:16.160
Mr. En.

17:16.660 --> 17:20.414
I hope we get to meet the real you again.

17:22.166 --> 17:24.501
It really is a doll.

17:24.585 --> 17:28.756
It looks like En,
but it's full of flaws and unreliable.

17:28.839 --> 17:33.594
Yeah. He doesn't have
the mushrooms he grows or Kikurage.

17:34.094 --> 17:37.306
Looks like he's killing time,
wandering the mansion.

17:38.265 --> 17:41.185
- Oh, everyone's here!
- Fujita!

17:44.271 --> 17:45.939
Mr. En!

17:46.023 --> 17:47.149
No, it's a doll!

17:51.403 --> 17:53.155
Oh goodness.

17:53.238 --> 17:55.240
Shin, the doll's gone!

17:55.324 --> 17:56.200
What?

18:03.916 --> 18:06.835
The doll of Mr. En can use a Broom?

18:06.919 --> 18:07.961
Shin!

18:08.045 --> 18:09.838
Wait for us!

18:24.853 --> 18:26.522
At this rate, we'll lose him!

18:26.605 --> 18:29.483
Why is that Broom
filled with so much smoke?

18:29.566 --> 18:33.320
You keep chasing him.
I'll get ahead of him from the roof.

18:33.403 --> 18:34.988
Got it!

18:44.832 --> 18:46.834
Damn! He's fast!

18:50.671 --> 18:53.841
This should do it. Take this!

18:57.886 --> 19:00.722
You did well, Noi.

19:09.356 --> 19:11.316
Yes! He's slowing down!

19:12.609 --> 19:13.861
Oh goodness.

19:20.367 --> 19:23.579
I was surprised
when I saw the news that En had died.

19:23.662 --> 19:27.332
But was it really the boss who killed En?

19:27.416 --> 19:30.836
Who else would take En's head?
It had to be the boss!

19:30.919 --> 19:35.966
Even if something happens,
we have a lot of healing smoke.

19:36.049 --> 19:40.220
I was worried
when Dokuga killed the Shaitan guys,

19:40.721 --> 19:43.974
but at least we don't have to fear
En being found dead.

19:44.057 --> 19:45.809
Great timing.

19:45.893 --> 19:47.978
To think the boss will now be back...

19:49.104 --> 19:53.108
Dokuga, are you sure
you know where the boss is?

19:53.901 --> 19:54.985
Possibly.

20:29.061 --> 20:31.480
INCOMING CALL...

20:37.611 --> 20:39.238
- Boss?
- What?

20:39.321 --> 20:42.449
I called you over and over again.

20:42.991 --> 20:43.951
Where've you been?

20:44.034 --> 20:47.621
Is that you, Boss? It's me! Ushishimada!

20:47.704 --> 20:50.123
So it really was you who killed En, Boss!

20:50.207 --> 20:52.209
Is the boss there? What's he saying?

20:52.292 --> 20:54.878
Thank goodness! The boss is alive!

20:54.962 --> 20:56.004
CALL ENDED

20:57.339 --> 20:58.507
He hung up.

21:02.636 --> 21:05.430
Was that really the boss just now?

21:05.514 --> 21:07.307
What do you think? Dokuga.

21:07.975 --> 21:10.394
- Dokuga!
- Oh, dear.

21:11.520 --> 21:13.438
Anyway, let's hurry.

21:21.238 --> 21:25.200
Is Mr. En's head
really in this run-down building?

21:25.284 --> 21:28.161
And probably the Cross-Eyes' boss too.

21:28.245 --> 21:31.623
I can finally get back at that bastard.

21:39.381 --> 21:40.424
All right!

21:42.884 --> 21:45.304
Is something wrong, Shin?

21:46.430 --> 21:50.309
Lately, I feel like
someone's been watching me.

21:50.392 --> 21:51.351
What?

21:51.435 --> 21:53.979
No, it's fine. Don't worry about it.

21:57.566 --> 21:59.985
This is it. I think it's that room.

22:04.239 --> 22:06.241
Is that the boss?

22:21.965 --> 22:22.924
This room?

22:23.008 --> 22:24.634
The boss is in here!

22:32.017 --> 22:34.478
There's someone in there. I'm sure of it.

22:35.479 --> 22:37.189
What do we do?

22:37.272 --> 22:39.649
Let's try opening it. Yeah?

22:39.733 --> 22:42.736
No, we should ring the intercom.

22:46.740 --> 22:47.908
Well, well.

22:47.991 --> 22:50.160
Whoa! Look who's here!

22:50.243 --> 22:52.120
We found the bastards!

22:52.204 --> 22:54.664
The Cleaners from the En family!

24:29.634 --> 24:30.927
THE END

24:31.011 --> 24:33.221
What we learned in Episode 8.

24:33.305 --> 24:35.765
It's crazy how many things
En created with his magic.

24:35.849 --> 24:37.142
Haru loves to sing.

24:37.225 --> 24:38.894
Asu is very mindful of Nikaido.

24:38.977 --> 24:43.398
What we'll learn in Episode 9
is still hidden in chaos.

24:43.482 --> 24:45.942
This is Dorohedoro.
